<title>USA: Sequim SD 323, Wash., yields 5.55 pct in 2014.</title>
<headline>Sequim SD 323, Wash., yields 5.55 pct in 2014.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $7 million of Sequim School District No 323, Clallam and Jefferson Counties, Wash., unlimited tax general obligation bonds, 1997, with a top yield of 5.55 percent in 2014.</p>
